{"id": "JAH-SIG-REPRODUC-000001", "slug": "tool-reproducibility-evidence-auditor-signature", "title": "Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor \u2014 Overview and definition", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Tracks data, parameters, software versions, procedures, and results needed to reproduce an experiment. The Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor packages everything needed to redo an experiment: input data checksums, parameter values, software versions, the exact procedure steps, and the results obtained. It verifies the package is complete \u2014 every result traces to inputs \u2014 and issues a reproducibility grade. A research-integrity tool. Capability specification and design target: this database describes what the tool must do, not a claim of implementation or deployment. Defensive and engineering content only \u2014 no weapon-targeting or attack-execution content.", "capabilities": ["Input-data checksum capture", "Parameter and version logging", "Procedure-step recording", "Result-to-input traceability", "Reproducibility grading"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Tool overview and capability inventory", "code": "J({tool:TOOL.name,capabilities:TOOL.capabilities,count:TOOL.capabilities.length});assert(TOOL.capabilities.length>=5,'caps');", "verified_output": "{\"tool\":\"Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor\",\"capabilities\":[\"Input-data checksum capture\",\"Parameter and version logging\",\"Procedure-step recording\",\"Result-to-input traceability\",\"Reproducibility grading\"],\"count\":5}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-darpa-nasa-grade-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "