{"id": "JAH-SIG-REPRODUC-000004", "slug": "tool-reproducibility-evidence-auditor-signature", "title": "Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor \u2014 Worked example", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 7, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Audit a model-training run: capture data checksums, 23 hyperparameters, library versions \u2014 grade A-, missing the random seed.", "capabilities": ["Input-data checksum capture", "Parameter and version logging", "Procedure-step recording", "Result-to-input traceability", "Reproducibility grading"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Worked example end to end", "code": "const terms=[['3x^3',3,3],['-2x',-2,1],['5',5,0]];const deriv=terms.map(([t,c,p])=>p===0?null:{c:c*p,p:p-1}).filter(Boolean);const s=deriv.map(d=>`${d.c}x^${d.p}`).join(' + ');J({derivative:s});assert(s==='9x^2 + -2x^0','symbolic');", "verified_output": "{\"derivative\":\"9x^2 + -2x^0\"}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-darpa-nasa-grade-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Mission-Level Verification Engine", "Experiment Design Optimizer", "Audit Logger"], "sibling_edition": "tool-reproducibility-evidence-auditor"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-REPRODUC-000005", "slug": "tool-reproducibility-evidence-auditor-signature", "title": "Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor \u2014 Safety, limits, and failure modes", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 9, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Audits the record, not the science; a complete package can still contain a flawed method \u2014 it guarantees redoability, not truth. Capability specification and design target: this database describes what the tool must do, not a claim of implementation or deployment. Defensive and engineering content only \u2014 no weapon-targeting or attack-execution content.", "capabilities": ["Input-data checksum capture", "Parameter and version logging", "Procedure-step recording", "Result-to-input traceability", "Reproducibility grading"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Safety limits enforced", "code": "const pkg={data:'abc123',params:{a:1},version:'2.0',steps:['run'],results:[1,2]};const complete=['data','params','version','steps','results'].every(k=>k in pkg);const grade=complete&&pkg.params.seed!==undefined?'A':'A- (missing seed)';J({complete,grade});assert(complete,'repro');", "verified_output": "{\"complete\":true,\"grade\":\"A- (missing seed)\"}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-darpa-nasa-grade-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Mission-Level Verification Engine", "Experiment Design Optimizer", "Audit Logger"], "sibling_edition": "tool-reproducibility-evidence-auditor"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-REPRODUC-000006", "slug": "tool-reproducibility-evidence-auditor-signature", "title": "Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor \u2014 Beginner teaching exercise", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 2, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Start simple: identify the tool's single core action for Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor, run it once on a tiny input, and verify the output matches expectations before scaling up.", "capabilities": ["Input-data checksum capture", "Parameter and version logging", "Procedure-step recording", "Result-to-input traceability", "Reproducibility grading"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Teaching exercise: beginner", "code": "const papers=[{f:'X improves yield',m:'RCT'},{f:'X harms yield',m:'observational'}];const agree=papers.filter(p=>p.f.includes('improves')).length;J({papers:2,agree,contradict:2-agree});assert(agree===1,'litmap');", "verified_output": "{\"papers\":2,\"agree\":1,\"contradict\":1}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-darpa-nasa-grade-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Mission-Level Verification Engine", "Experiment Design Optimizer", "Audit Logger"], "sibling_edition": "tool-reproducibility-evidence-auditor"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-REPRODUC-000007", "slug": "tool-reproducibility-evidence-auditor-signature", "title": "Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor \u2014 Advanced pattern", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 11, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Advanced use of Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor composes it with neighboring tools: chain its output into the next tool, add verification checkpoints, and automate the sequence once the manual path is proven.", "capabilities": ["Input-data checksum capture", "Parameter and version logging", "Procedure-step recording", "Result-to-input traceability", "Reproducibility grading"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Advanced pattern: lab scheduling", "code": "const jobs=[{n:'A',dur:2,inst:'ms'},{n:'B',dur:1,inst:'ms'},{n:'C',dur:3,inst:'nmr'}];const t={};const busy={};let ok=true;jobs.forEach(j=>{let s=0;while(busy[j.inst]&&busy[j.inst].some(([a,b])=>s<b&&s+j.dur>a))s++;(busy[j.inst]=busy[j.inst]||[]).push([s,s+j.dur]);t[j.n]=s;});J({schedule:t});assert(t.B===2,'schedule');", "verified_output": "{\"schedule\":{\"A\":0,\"B\":2,\"C\":0}}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-darpa-nasa-grade-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Mission-Level Verification Engine", "E